note stand-in for vec.om export 3 (vcopy s view ushort * d edit ushort *): an index of d at or past
note its count traps 3, as the OM-2 element check does.
fn vcopy s view ushort 16777216 n ulong d edit ushort 16777216 m ulong to ulong
for i ulong n
if ge i m
trap 3
end
put d i get s i
end
ret n
end
